  "details": "In the 27 August 2026 Developer Update (https://ask.vrchat.com/t/developer-update-27-august-2026/48877#p-90617-material-contacts-6) Material Contacts were announced giving creators a way to copy Transform data from the Contact Receiver itself and 4 nearby Contact Senders.  \n\nHowever this still comes at the cost of 1 Contact Sender and (at least) 1 Contact Receiver.\n\nIt would be nice to if there was also a dedicated component for this functionality separate from the Contacts where you can use your own predefined Transforms instead of needing to rely on using Contact Senders and Contact Receivers.",
